      "reasons": [
        "The definition says “Here and now refers to what is happening in real time … within a person” and “moment by moment.” The packet supports the idea of “real-time processes” and that creativity processes can be “intra-individual,” but it does not explicitly define “here and now” as “within a person” or as “moment by moment” in the way the definition states.",
        "The definition claims that this means “focusing on immediate, ongoing change rather than only on overall outcomes.” The packet discusses interest in “real-time processes” and “intra-individual variability as a mechanism of change,” but it does not contrast this with “overall outcomes” in the specific way required by the definition."
